                                            <h1 style="font-size:18px;padding: 7px 10px;display:block;clear: both;background: #cddeed;margin: 20px 0px 20px 0px;color:#114874;font-weight: 400;"> Primary Skill Evaluation:<strong style="font-weight:500;"> @Model.JDTiltle</strong></h1>
                                            <div class="mandatory-note"> Please fill the meeting status, interview status, questions & score rubric to complete the primary skill evaluation process</div>

