                                                                <p><span style="text-transform:none;position: static;font-weight: bold;color: #2ceb3e;">Marginal Selected:</span> Candidates whose score falls within 70-85%.</p>
                                                                <p><span style="text-transform:none;position: static;font-weight: bold;color: #f48562;">Marginal Rejected:</span> Candidates whose score falls within 60-70%.</p>
                                                                <p><span style="text-transform:none;position: static;font-weight: bold;color: #ec5425;">Strongly Rejected:</span> Candidates whose score falls below 60%.</p>
