                                                    </label>

                                                </label>
                                                <fieldset class="answer">
                                                    @if (ViewBag.profile == "Interviewer")
                                                    {

                                                        <p>  Note: If the candidate is on the range of values, then take the lower experience category only, for example if the candidate has 3 years of experience, then take 1 - 3 years only.</p>
